AltoStaking::getVotes()
├── when user has no positions
│   └── it should return zero votes
├── when user has expired positions only
│   └── it should return zero votes
├── when contract is in pause mode
│   └── it should return zero votes
├── when contract is in rescue mode
│   └── it should return zero votes
└── when user has active positions
    ├── when user has single active position
    │   ├── it should calculate votes as amount * multiplier
    │   └── it should return correct voting power
    ├── when user has multiple active positions in same container
    │   ├── it should sum all amounts in container
    │   ├── it should multiply by container multiplier
    │   └── it should return correct total voting power
    ├── when user has active positions in different containers
    │   ├── it should calculate votes for each container separately
    │   ├── it should apply respective multipliers
    │   ├── it should sum all voting powers
    │   └── it should return correct total voting power
    ├── when user has mix of active and expired positions
    │   ├── it should include only non-expired positions
    │   ├── it should ignore expired positions
    │   └── it should return voting power for active positions only
    ├── when containers have different multipliers
    │   ├── it should apply correct multiplier to each container
    │   ├── it should calculate proportional voting power
    │   └── it should return accurate weighted total
    ├── when testing calculation accuracy
    │   └── it should handle precise amounts correctly
    ├── when multiple users have positions
    │   └── it should calculate voting power independently for each user
    ├── when positions are partially unlocked
    │   └── it should decrease voting power by unlocked amount
    ├── when containers are deprecated
    │   └── it should still count votes for existing positions in deprecated containers
    └── when position has zero amount
        └── it should return zero votes 